{
  "name": "HL · Load policies (B4)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Load policies (B4)\nBoss 4, D1 + curveball 1. One workflow, so the old version can't be forgotten:\n1. Delete the old chunks for this source (Postgres).\n2. Download the policy (a Google Doc exported as text, headings as ## lines).\n3. Split into sections in code, then insert with metadata source, section and version.\nAfter every load, re-run the evaluation harness (add a case for the new rule, e.g. must_include \"10%\").\n\n**Credentials:** Postgres (Supabase DB); Google Drive OAuth2; Supabase; OpenAI (embeddings).\n**Replace:** YOUR_POLICY_DOC_ID; YOUR_POLICY_VERSION (e.g. 2026-11-01) in Default Data Loader; policies.txt if you use a different source name (2 places).",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "6c1fbc29-c229-435d-9ea7-f8fe736737c3",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "433a69c8-d268-4146-9131-327d79947fa1",
      "name": "Load policies",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
